DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42047::$$$message_0231_0000_0000$$$::"Thou hast finally arrived.[lr]::
42048::$$$message_0231_0000_0001$$$::Bearer of the Holy Grail, foolish yet beautiful, devoted to thy wish."::
42049::$$$message_0231_0000_0002$$$::"Wha... Y-you're alive, Kirei!?"::
42050::$$$message_0231_0000_0003$$$::"Oh? Your profile did look familiar. So it's you."::
42051::$$$message_0231_0000_0004$$$::"There's no reason to be surprised.[lr]::
42052::$$$message_0231_0000_0005$$$::We're both dead people. A trivial exception every now and then is nothing to be hung up about."::
42053::$$$message_0231_0000_0006$$$::"Uh... [hfwww layer=1]E-even I'm still alive too, yeah! I knew you were too sturdy to die!"::
42054::$$$message_0231_0000_0007$$$::"........."::
42055::$$$message_0231_0000_0008$$$::"..."::
42056::$$$message_0231_0000_0009$$$::"That's right. It wouldn't make sense for you to retire without putting up a fight."::
42057::$$$message_0231_0000_0010$$$::"I'm sure you were just observing, waiting for the dust to settle.[lr]::
42058::$$$message_0231_0000_0011$$$::Truly, you're meticulous to a fault."::
42059::$$$message_0231_0000_0012$$$::"........."::
42060::$$$message_0231_0000_0013$$$::"But you can't hide anymore. If you're alive, then that should calm Caren down, and more importantly..."::
42061::$$$message_0231_0000_0014$$$::"..."::
42062::$$$message_0231_0000_0015$$$::"...Kirei? Why aren't you saying anything?[lr]::
42063::$$$message_0231_0000_0016$$$::Have I said something wrong...?"::
42064::$$$message_0231_0000_0017$$$::"No, I was just chewing upon the strange irony of fate."::
42065::$$$message_0231_0000_0018$$$::"So...have you come to take revenge on me, Bazett Fraga McRemitz? I believe that's the relationship we have."::
42066::$$$message_0231_0000_0019$$$::"Huh...? [wait canskip=0 time=300]No, I... I... [wait canskip=0 time=200]Revenge? [wait canskip=0 time=200]What do you..."::
42067::$$$message_0231_0000_0020$$$::"Then why have you come?[lr]::
42068::$$$message_0231_0000_0021$$$::I can think of no other reason."::
42069::$$$message_0231_0000_0022$$$::"Th-there is one![lr]::
42070::$$$message_0231_0000_0023$$$::I'm here to visit an onsen to have my wish granted!"::
42071::$$$message_0231_0000_0024$$$::"Ah, so that's it.[lr]::
42072::$$$message_0231_0000_0025$$$::Well, you're in the right place. I'm the one who passed out those flyers."::
42073::$$$message_0231_0000_0026$$$::"Eh?"::
42074::$$$message_0231_0000_0027$$$::"You...made this flyer?"::
42075::$$$message_0231_0000_0028$$$::"Yes, and?[lr]::
42076::$$$message_0231_0000_0029$$$::Did you find some portion of it difficult to understand?"::
42077::$$$message_0231_0000_0030$$$::"...No."::
42078::$$$message_0231_0000_0031$$$::"I've come to this onsen to have my wish granted."::
42079::$$$message_0231_0000_0032$$$::"I see. A wish, you say.[lr]::
42080::$$$message_0231_0000_0033$$$::I didn't think you were the type of person who lived so simply."::
42081::$$$message_0231_0000_0034$$$::"...! W-well, even I have a wish or...two..."::
42082::$$$message_0231_0000_0035$$$::"That is good.[lr]::
42083::$$$message_0231_0000_0036$$$::So you've matured enough to wish for your own sake."::
42084::$$$message_0231_0000_0037$$$::"However, you seem to have regressed back to your former state upon arriving here."::
42085::$$$message_0231_0001_0000$$$::"You've made no progress, McRemitz.[lr]::
42086::$$$message_0231_0001_0001$$$::Have you truly fallen to this place in hopes of meeting me once more?"::
42087::$$$message_0231_0001_0002$$$::"Gh...!"::
42088::$$$message_0231_0001_0003$$$::"Then there is no need for you to pass any further.[lr]::
42089::$$$message_0231_0001_0004$$$::Your wish has been granted. Now, leave this dark forest with all due haste."::
42090::$$$message_0231_0001_0005$$$::"...No."[lr]::
42091::$$$message_0231_0001_0006$$$::I don't need to do that, Executor. My goal is behind you."::
42092::$$$message_0231_0001_0007$$$::"Hm."::
42093::$$$message_0231_0001_0008$$$::"It's...infuriating.[lr]::
42094::$$$message_0231_0001_0009$$$::Losing things. Seeing the miracle I'd given up on appear before my very eyes. Losing sight of what matters to me."::
42095::$$$message_0231_0001_0010$$$::"Get out of my way.[lr]::
42096::$$$message_0231_0001_0011$$$::If you won't, then this time, I'll take you down face-to-face."::
42097::$$$message_0231_0001_0012$$$::"...You have changed.[lr]::
42098::$$$message_0231_0001_0013$$$::I see you've learned a slightly simpler way of life."::
42099::$$$message_0231_0001_0014$$$::"And what about you?[lr]::
42100::$$$message_0231_0001_0015$$$::You heard your Master, but do you have any will left to fight?"::
42101::$$$message_0231_0001_0016$$$::"Uh, me?[lr]::
42102::$$$message_0231_0001_0017$$$::Hmm... We're cut from the same cloth. I'd rather not get involved, though..."::
42103::$$$message_0231_0001_0018$$$::"...But I owe my Master, so I'll rip your head off."::
42104::$$$message_0231_0001_0019$$$::"Oh, and give me the girl."::
42105::$$$message_0231_0001_0020$$$::"You're a greedy one, Avenger.[lr]::
42106::$$$message_0231_0001_0021$$$::You'll have to satisfy yourself with just one."::
42107::$$$message_0231_0001_0022$$$::"No way, man. There's no end to what I want. That's just what it means to be me.[lr]::
42108::$$$message_0231_0001_0023$$$::But of course..."::
42109::$$$message_0231_0001_0024$$$::"You can never take hold of your desires, yes?"::
42110::$$$message_0231_0001_0025$$$::"Yeah. We've both got a raw deal, being convenient villains."::
42111::$$$message_0231_0001_0026$$$::"Very well.[lr]::
42112::$$$message_0231_0001_0027$$$::Then let us begin this fruitless gift exchange, Black Santa."::
42113::$$$message_0231_0002_0000$$$::"Show me what you've gained after being ejected from the stage.":lð